{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the <i>Marble Run Maker</i> demo! Build tracks in the first three levels, but be careful\u2014bad balancing might send everything crashing down!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630560/extras/Ball_Roling2.gif?t=1745004922\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A game about stacking physically simulated objects like books and toys to make a marble run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Your Goal-</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630560/extras/Start_and_End.gif?t=1745004922\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start here. End there. Build something wild in between. One goal, infinite possibilities. The only thing stopping you is your creativity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Simple control-</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630560/extras/Controls4.gif?t=1745004922\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">move things around and Rotate to perfectly place where you want.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Undo System -</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630560/extras/UndoExample.gif?t=1745004922\" />Made a small mistake and everything fall ;_;? no worries just undo with <strong><i>ctrl + z</i></strong>.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you're looking to chill and be a little creative, then this is the perfect demo for you to try.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Featuring:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Advance Controls;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Open ended puzzles meaning there is no one fit solution;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">no time pressure to solve the puzzle;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cozy Vibes;</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3630560?t=1745004922","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3630560?t=1745004922","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630560/854f2b07fb847449e9def674983bd89f73c2e5a5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745004922","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630560/854f2b07fb847449e9def674983bd89f73c2e5a5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745004922","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the <i>Marble Run Maker</i> demo! Build tracks in the first three levels, but be careful\u2014bad balancing might send everything crashing down!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630560/extras/Ball_Roling2.gif?t=1745004922\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A game about stacking physically simulated objects like books and toys to make a marble run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Your Goal-</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630560/extras/Start_and_End.gif?t=1745004922\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start here. End there. Build something wild in between. One goal, infinite possibilities. The only thing stopping you is your creativity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Simple control-</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630560/extras/Controls4.gif?t=1745004922\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">move things around and Rotate to perfectly place where you want.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Undo System -</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630560/extras/UndoExample.gif?t=1745004922\" />Made a small mistake and everything fall ;_;? no worries just undo with <strong><i>ctrl + z</i></strong>.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you're looking to chill and be a little creative, then this is the perfect demo for you to try.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Featuring:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Advance Controls;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Open ended puzzles meaning there is no one fit solution;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">no time pressure to solve the puzzle;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cozy Vibes;</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2>","developers":["Raikar Entertainment"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3447420","name":"Marble Run Maker"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630560/dd68dcc4e4e8b08371f4a6d1a8b04e1bd68138b5/header.jpg?t=1745004922","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257126398,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126398/movie480.mp4?t=1744736864","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126398/movie_max.mp4?t=1744736864"},"name":"Announcment Trailer 2","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257126398/bfd837b276589e0ae7a2737bb5ad0f945499eed5/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744736864","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic